amily:&quot;Sentient&quot;, ui-serif, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:20px;color:#141417" width="112"/><img class="lw-dark-only" alt="LangWatch" height="27" src="https://app.langwatch.ai/images/logo-full-darktheme.svg" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:&quot;Sentient&quot;, ui-serif, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:20px;color:#f5f4f1" width="112"/></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 class="lw-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:&quot;Sentient&quot;, ui-serif, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#141417">Budget increase request</h1><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><strong>Morgan Ellis</strong> (<a class="lw-link" href="mailto:morgan@acme.example" style="color:#141417;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">morgan@acme.example</a>) has requested a budget increase in <strong>Acme Corp</strong>.</p><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Scope</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">project</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Scope ID</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">project_KAXYxPR8MUgTcP8CF193y</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Period</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">September 2026</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Current limit</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">$250.00</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Spent so far</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">$248.60</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="lw-panel" style="margin:16px 0;padding:16px;background-color:#fdece0;border-radius:10px"><tbody><tr><td><p class="lw-panel-ink" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:#a83e05;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><strong>Message from Morgan Ellis</strong></p><p class="lw-panel-ink" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:#a83e05;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">We are running the new support agent evaluation this week and it needs roughly double the usual headroom until Friday.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:24px 0"><tbody><tr><td><a class="lw-action" href="https://app.langwatch.ai/settings/budgets" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#141417;border:1px solid #141417;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-radius:999px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Review the budget</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:24px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">You are receiving this because you administer Acme Corp. You can reply straight to morgan@acme.example.</p><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">LangWatch ·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai" style="color:#141417;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Documentation</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="mailto:support@langwatch.ai" style="color:#141417;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">support@langwatch.ai</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
