d></tr></tbody></table><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">If this was a mistake, you can safely ignore this email.</p><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:24px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">LangWatch ·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai" style="color:#141417;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Documentation</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="mailto:support@langwatch.ai" style="color:#141417;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">support@langwatch.ai</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
